## API

- `GET /api/health` returns `{"status":"ok"}`.
{{- if ne .database "none" }}
- `GET /api/items` lists items.
- `POST /api/items` creates an item with a JSON body such as `{"name":"First item"}`.
{{- end }}

{{- if ne .database "none" }}

## Database

The Prisma schema lives in `prisma/schema.prisma`. After changing it, create a
migration and regenerate the client:

```bash
npx prisma migrate dev --name describe_change
```

Use `npx prisma studio` to inspect the local database.

{{- end }}

